/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
*.snap.new
# `.prova/` is SOURCE, not build output: it holds this project's manifest, its runtime companion,
# and its local plugins. Only genuinely generated artifacts are ignored — and prova's own generated
# state needs no entry here at all: it lives in `.prova/var/`, which carries its own `.gitignore`
# of `*`. That self-ignore composes recursively (every package ignores its own state, at any depth),
# which is why the `--last-failed` record and held-topology run-state have no lines in this file.
# (This repo's own /.luarc.json is COMMITTED and points at library/ — the hand-written source stubs
# — because prova is where they come from.)
# Generated LuaLS IDE artifacts from running the example suites. prova writes .luarc.json into each
# example's project root; it holds machine-local absolute paths, so it is per-machine, not shared.
examples/**/.luarc.json
